        "VwByAGkAdABlAC0ASABvAHMAdAAgACcAaABlAGwAbABvACcA",
        "VwByAGkAdABlAC0ASABvAHMAdAAgACcAaABlAGwAbABvACcA"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass VwByAGkAdABlAC0ASABvAHMAdAAgACcAaABlAGwAbABvACcA;pwsh -EncodedArguments VwByAGkAdABlAC0ASABvAHMAdAAgACcAaABlAGwAbABvACcA;powershell -eX VwByAGkAdABlAC0ASABvAHMAdAAgACcAaABlAGwAbABvACcA",
      "values": []
